              "value": 9
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "You can cast purify food and drink as a primal innate spell, but only on liquids.\n\nYou can cast this spell once every 10 minutes. You can also use your innate purify food and drink on a touched creature instead of a liquid to purify their blood, giving that creature a +2 status bonus for 1 minute on their ongoing saves against poisons already present in their body when you cast the spell."
            }
          }
        }
